  "instructions": [
    "char the lotus leaf wraps over medium heat for 2 minutes.",
    "in a bain-marie, melt 2 tbsp of unsalted butter over low heat.",
    "add 2 tbsp of ssamjang to the melted butter and stir until combined.",
    "add the smoked salmon fillet to the ssamjang mixture and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "add the chopped green onions and crushed sesame seeds to the fillet and stir until combined.",
    "season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "warm the lotus leaf wraps by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "assemble the wrap by placing the salmon mixture onto a lotus leaf wrap and serving immediately.",
    "serve with french fries on the side."
